Captains search lakes rivers cities mountains forests all around --- Monkeys bed nightly under fruitful trees during quest --- Vinata returns eastward Sītāless to Prasravaṇa hopeless --- Śatabali returns northward with army Sītāless --- Suṣēṇa returns westward after full month greeting Sugrīva --- Returners report searched mountains cities seas caves thickets --- Returners report huge beasts searched slain dense lands rescanned --- Returners declare Hanumān southbound will find Maithilī
